  "title": "New TV App and Streaming Features",
  "summary": "The creator of TV Time is building a successor app that will let users import their watch histories and preserve the community that formed around discussing their favorite shows. YouTube Premium will introduce Peacock content directly through its app in 2027, allowing users to stream ad-supported shows, movies, and live sports without leaving the platform. The price of Roku’s streaming hardware has increased by up to $50, affecting all of its other devices.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The creator of TV Time is building a successor app that will let users import their watch histories and preserve the community that formed around discussing their favorite shows.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "YouTube Premium will introduce Peacock content directly through its app in 2027, allowing users to stream ad-supported shows, movies, and live sports without leaving the platform.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The price of Roku’s streaming hardware has increased by up to $50, affecting all of its other devices as well",
